abstract: "Empirical proof that co-locating Direct Lithium Extraction with binary-cycle geothermal recovery in depleted petroleum wellbores produces +1.95 MWe surplus electricity (EROI = 11.38), abates -14.82 kg CO2e/kg LCE, and defeats Modbus sensor spoofing via NIST SP 800-82 Navier-Stokes invariants."
